<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<WorkflowBuilder Version="2.9.0"
                 xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                 xmlns:rx="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Reactive;assembly=Bonsai.Core"
                 xmlns:trl="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Trials;assembly=OpenRigs.Trials"
                 xmlns="https://bonsai-rx.org/2018/workflow">
  <Description>What every trial's outcome sets off, the same in every task: give it each trial's outcome (a TrialOutcome or a type derived from it, as the trial loop's Outcome event carries it). On a rewarded outcome (Rewarded) its Reward is sent into RewardRequests (OpenRigs.Devices Rewards) first; then its Row into TrialRow once its valve's RewardDelivered (the board's answer, a few ms later) came for it, rewarded (RewardedAsDelivered): not rewarded when the next outcome comes first, and no row when the stop comes first, so a reward the stop cut off is never logged as given; on a penalised outcome (Penalised) it plays the lab's penalty sound at the trial's PenaltyLevelDbfs (OpenRigs.Audio PlayPenaltySound; nothing when mute). Each outcome is passed on, for what a task sets off at the outcome itself (its spouts, a reward tone). Needs TrialRow, RewardRequests and RewardDelivered declared (Rewards declares the last two), and what PlayPenaltySound needs (TrialRules, Speakers).</Description>
  <Workflow>
    <Nodes>
      <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
        <Name>Source1</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
        <Name>Rewarded?</Name>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Rewarded</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
        <Selector>Reward</Selector>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
        <Name>RewardRequests</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>RewardDelivered</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="trl:RewardedAsDelivered" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
        <Name>TrialRow</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
        <Name>Penalised?</Name>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Penalised</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
        <Selector>PenaltyLevelDbfs</Selector>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Audio:PlayPenaltySound.bonsai" />
      <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="0" To="5" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source2" />
      <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="0" To="7" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="0" To="10" Label="Source1" />
    </Edges>
  </Workflow>
</WorkflowBuilder>
